---
// Not to scale. Shows why we watch from across the water on launch day.
---

<svg class="schematic" viewBox="0 0 820 560" role="img" aria-labelledby="view-title view-desc">
  <title id="view-title">Launch-day viewing geometry around Starbase</title>
  <desc id="view-desc">
    Highway 4 runs east from Brownsville to Starbase and Boca Chica Beach and closes on launch day. The public watches
    from Isla Blanca Park at the south tip of South Padre Island, about 5 miles north of the pad across Brazos Santiago
    Pass, or from Port Isabel across the Laguna Madre.
  </desc>

  <rect x="600" y="0" width="220" height="560" fill="#06121b" />
  <text x="690" y="60" fill="#3a6b8c" font-family="JetBrains Mono" font-size="12" letter-spacing="3">GULF</text>

